{"id":"n68206-1-10","stage":0,"title":"오늘 · 今天","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68206-1-10-1","ko":"오늘 저녁엔 뭐 먹을까?","zh":"今天晚上吃啥好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"저녁엔","meaning":"晚饭，晚餐","explanation":"저녁：晚饭，晚餐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"2","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁엔","audio":"/audio/a77d888257e2cba07198.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을까?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을까","audio":"/audio/5376369aa2d708aa98ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"晚饭，晚餐","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"晚上吃的饭。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/920d9e392f699f7841e3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68206-1-10-2","ko":"날씨도 더운데 시원한 냉면 먹으러 가자.","zh":"天气这么热，咱们去吃冷面吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날씨도","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨도","audio":"/audio/0933cc8d3e4f29fc2621.mp3"}},{"text":"더운데","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더운데","audio":"/audio/6a4a31748d07da622588.mp3"}},{"text":"시원한","meaning":"清凉的","explanation":"시원하다：凉爽、清凉；-ㄴ 修饰后面的 냉면，这里形容冷面吃起来清爽。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"1","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원한","audio":"/audio/eb75ec9a411a296929cc.mp3"}},{"text":"냉면","meaning":"韩式冷面","explanation":"냉면：韩式冷面，常用凉汤或拌酱食用。","readings":[{"term":"냉면","audio":"/audio/0bd080fa0243c64881e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32777","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냉면","audio":"/audio/0bd080fa0243c64881e5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으러","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으러","audio":"/audio/3bc7725f95e57fc73de6.mp3"}},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；-자 是邀请一起做事的非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio"